---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Copyright | Kvisl" description="Kvisl copyright and reuse information.">
  <main class="container page-main narrow-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Copyright</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Copyright</h1>
    <div class="policy-copy">
      <p>Unless otherwise stated, original <span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span> writing, editorial arrangement, and visual design are protected by copyright.</p>
      <p>Reasonable quotation is permitted when context is preserved and the author, article title, and <span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span> are clearly credited.</p>
      <p>Full republication, translation, adaptation, syndication, and commercial reuse require a paid licence from <span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span>. Licensing starts at US$600 per article and may be higher depending on the work, our editorial and creative contribution, the original author's terms, territory, language, medium, and duration.</p>
      <p>Third-party images and source material remain subject to the rights and licence terms of their respective owners.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
